       "hide": null,
       "html": "<p><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-f3735e1 ); font-size: 1rem;\">The Irish Life Experience has strict requirements to be accepted into the program, which include the following:</span></p><ul><li>An application is completed by the student and student's parent(s).</li><li>Faculty recommendations are completed.</li><li>All are submitted with a $600 deposit.</li><li>Students are notified of approval/denial within 14 days.</li><li>An additional $1,000 deposit is required by March 1.</li><li>Full payment is due by June 1.</li></ul>"
